        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "The Grim Reaper",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Participate in multiple player matches for kills, class criteria or race criteria.\n\n1. Join a player battleground and stay near your team's main fight. Large fights give more opportunities for shared honorable-kill credit than isolated duels.\n\n2. Help defeat enemy players and receive 30 honorable kills in that single match. These are HONORABLE KILLS, not 30 personal killing blows; healers can contribute without switching to a damage specialization.\n\n3. Watch the match scoreboard, return to the fighting after deaths and stay until you have the required credit. Kills from separate battlegrounds do not satisfy the one-battle description.",
