        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - High personal rating needs sustained competitive performance and suitable teammates.\n\n1. Form a group of 3 players and enter the RATED 3v3 arena queue from the Rated PvP panel. A Solo Shuffle rating, rated battleground rating or unrated skirmish win is not this bracket's personal rating.\n\n2. Play completed matches and raise YOUR personal rating in that bracket to at least 1750. Inspect your character's rating after the result screen; a teammate already being above the threshold does not grant you their rating.\n\n3. Keep playing through wins and losses until your own rating reaches the target, then check the achievement. No exact equality is required: crossing above 1750 is enough. Old arena-team purchase and team-rating instructions are obsolete.",
