        },
        tips = "The wardrobe change supersedes the old collection macros. Later-expansion tabards do not all advance this older counter, so the route uses the established original, Outland, Northrend and Cataclysm choices. Refunds can remove an appearance; do not copy the old buy-and-refund trick. The seven-entry city/guild batch is an upper total if none was already collected.",
