allmar's main building, Hellfire Peninsula. Follow The Assassin and its follow-ups through the Mag'har introduction, removing their initial hostility. Then continue their quests at Garadar in Nagrand, OUTLAND. This is not the Mag'har allied-race unlock or Draenor's Nagrand.\n\n7. Finish the available Garadar quests to reduce the remaining grind, then kill Nagrand ogres around Laughing Skull Ruins/Ring of Blood or Warmaul Hill. Loot every corpse for Obsidian Warbeads. Other hostile Nagrand groups can give kill reputation, but the ogres also supply the repeatable turn-in item.\n\n8. Return to Warden Bullrok at Garadar and turn in sets of TEN Obsidian Warbeads for 500 reputation before bonuses. Keep alternating kills and hand-ins until Mag'har reaches Exalted. The eight ordinary reputation talbuks are optional purchases afterwards; Halaa battle tokens are unrelated to completing this reputation.\n\n9. Check all three Exalted criteria and select the Diplomat title when complete. Use the actual standing for how many turn-ins remain; old guides' totals include superseded reputation values and removed guild bonuses.",
