        tips = "The current checklist includes the Cataclysm city faction. Old guides listing only five cities or telling you to donate Runecloth are outdated. Spillover can stop before Exalted: equip each incomplete city's own tabard to finish its bar. Keep it equipped, rather than merely owning its appearance. If Embassy vendors are hidden by a local introduction or quest phase, finish that phase and return to the mapped vendors.",
