        tips = "Use the dedicated faction guides for their unlocks and reputation caps. Old lists include removed Zandalar Tribe/Shen'dralar grinds, Runecloth donations and pre-Cataclysm Timbermaw amounts; those methods are excluded. Spending gold is optional, and fixed completion times are not promised. The complete route offers forty distinct factions for either faction, with opposing allegiances counted only once. Stop at your own milestone; already-Exalted bars need no repeat grind. Do not lower an Exalted allegiance while relying on it for this count.",
