    [1563] = {
        achievementId = 1563,
        name = "Hail to the Chef",
        category = "Professions",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Hail to the Chef",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Combine multiple profession achievements with daily rotations, random rewards and special objectives.\n\n1. Choose a cook and expand the meta's missing achievements. Learn Northrend Cooking in Northrend Dalaran and raise that tier to 75 for Northrend Cook. Learn 100 distinct cooking recipes for Sous Chef; reaching 75 in a different expansion's tier is not the same criterion.\n\n2. Start The Rokk's Shattrath cooking daily early. Complete all four variants as they rotate: Manalicious, Revenge is Tasty, Soup for the Soul and Super Hot Stew. Open each Barrel of Fish/Crate of Meat and learn missing recipes, particularly Stormchops, Kibler's Bits, Skullfish Soup, Spicy Hot Talbuk and Delicious Chocolate Cake. The random recipes can take longer than the four quest variants.\n\n3. Also complete the five NORTHREND Dalaran cooking daily variants for Our Daily Bread: Cheese for Glowergold, Convention at the Legerdemain, Infused Mushroom Meatloaf, Mustard Dogs! and Sewer Stew. Katherine Lee serves Alliance; Awilo Lon'gomba serves Horde. Only today's variant is offered. Open the Small Spice Bag and save Epicurean's Awards for the recipe supplier beside your trainer.\n\n4. Complete The Outland Gourmet and The Northrend Gourmet's 45-recipe tier by COOKING every missing listed dish. Kylene in Shattrath directly teaches the three easy-to-miss recipes Stewed Trout, Fisherman's Feast and Hot Buttered Trout. Northrend's supplier sells Fish Feast, Worg Tartare and other recipes for awards. Gather each dish's ingredients; learning a recipe, buying its finished food or eating it does not replace cooking it.\n\n5. For the Kungaloosh gap in Northrend Gourmet, finish Grimbooze Thunderbrew's brewing quests at Nesingwary Base Camp, Sholazar Basin, including The Taste Test. Then speak to the Washed-Up Mage in the NORTHREND Dalaran Underbelly to learn Kungaloosh, and brew it. Use the Underbelly map entry for the mage; this is not Legion Dalaran's sewer.\n\n6. For The Cake Is Not A Lie, learn the random Delicious Chocolate Cake recipe and BAKE the cake. For Captain Rumsey's Lager, learn its recipe from an Outland/Northrend fishing daily's treasure bag, then BREW the lager. Buying either finished drink/cake is insufficient. Keep doing The Rokk and Dalaran dailies while waiting on recipe drops; Timewalking recipe containers provide extra chances when their event vendors are active.\n\n7. For Second That Emotion, EAT Bad Clams, Haunted Herring, Last Week's Mammoth and Tasty Cupcake. These four are eating criteria, unlike the Gourmet dishes. They can be bought as finished food if you do not want to cook them yourself; check each tick after consuming it.\n\n8. For Critter Gitter, bring at least ten Critter Bites to the Glacier Penguins northwest of Icecrown's Argent Tournament grounds, around 66.0, 21.7. Put the bites on an action bar and use one on each of ten DIFFERENT nearby penguins within three minutes. They stand close together. Avoid attacks/area damage that kill them. A February 2026 reply confirms this location; northern Mulgore's critter mesa around 35, 8 is another reported option.\n\n9. For Dinner Impossible, bring at least four GREAT FEASTS and place one during a match on each required map: Alterac Valley, Warsong Gulch, Arathi Basin and Eye of the Storm. Use the queue appropriate to the map; Alterac Valley is an epic battleground. Check each map's tick after placing it. A Fish Feast is not the specified item, and merely carrying feasts into a match is insufficient.\n\n10. Return to the meta, finish any remaining unchecked component and select the Chef title. Keep the recipe learning/cooking work on this cook. The title needs Sous Chef's 100 recipes, not Chef de Cuisine's 160 recipes, and owning a Chef's Hat is not a meta requirement.",
        stepCount = 10,
        waypoints = {
            {
                mapID = 125,
                x = 0.40299999999999997,
                y = 0.6609999999999999,
                step = 1,
                label = "Katherine Lee - Alliance Northrend Cooking",
