        },
        tips = "The old 450 unified Cooking cap has been replaced by expansion tiers. The Northrend Gourmet requirement is the 45-dish tier; a 2011 comment describing its 30-dish tier is outdated. Complete each dish's actual learn/cook/eat/place requirement rather than treating those actions as interchangeable.",
