d for the repeatable Waterlogged Recipe alternative. Open the recipe's Unlearned entry to see its tier, required skill and source.\n\n6. If only a few recipes remain, search the Auction House's Cooking recipes for inexpensive unlearned scrolls before waiting through many daily resets. Compare the scroll's name and required Cooking tier with this character's known recipes. Optional holiday recipes also count when their events are active; waiting for a holiday is unnecessary when a permanent unlearned recipe is available.\n\n7. Continue learning distinct recipes on this character until the counter reaches 100. Cooking the same dish repeatedly raises skill when eligible, but does not add another learned recipe. You do not need a removed recipe, every recipe in the game, or every faction-exclusive recipe to reach this target.",
