        name = "Challenger",
        category = "PvP",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Challenger",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Build personal rating in the specified active rated bracket.\n\n1. Play during an active rated PvP season. For a consistent arena route, form a 3v3 team through Group Finder and enter rated 3v3 matches. The old end-of-season battlegroup percentile system no longer describes these ranks.\n\n2. Raise your personal seasonal arena rating to 1600. Check the rated panel after each result; achievements for a fixed arena rating and the named seasonal rank are separate records.\n\n3. Check both the current season's rank achievement and this recurring achievement. Recent comments report the old recurring-rank credit bug was fixed in 12.0.0; if credit still fails, retain the season, bracket and rating details for a bug report.",
        stepCount = 3,
        waypoints = {},
