        tips = "Stop at your target; the later reputation batches are unnecessary for the 10/25 milestones. Temporary Magic Brooms do not count. Racial size restrictions, removed cloth donations and old profession-switching advice are obsolete. Use the achievement counter for class/profession edge cases rather than treating every historical comment as current. This route needs no retired seasonal or promotional mount.",
