        name = "Local Pet Mauler",
        source = "Local Pet Mauler",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Win in 10 distinct eligible zones, not repeatedly in one zone.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Win in 10 distinct eligible zones, not repeatedly in one zone.\n\n1. Track the zone checklist and enable wild-pet tracking. Plan a circuit through the listed Eastern Kingdoms, Kalimdor, Outland, Northrend and Pandaria zones; newer expansion zones are not substitutes for unchecked original criteria.\n\n2. In each unchecked zone, win a full wild-pet battle before moving across the border. You can capture a missing species in that battle too. A trainer is not required, and the location is where the battle occurs rather than where you learned the pet.\n\n3. Use Zidormi's earlier phase if a transformed zone gives no original credit: recent comments specifically identify Uldum and Arathi Highlands. Check the tracker immediately after your first win there instead of repeating uncredited battles.\n\n4. Continue until 10 different zones are checked. Repeated victories in an already-complete zone contribute ordinary win counters but do not advance this zone count.",
        stepCount = 4,
        waypoints = {
