        name = "Pet Brawler",
        source = "Pet Brawler",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Queued PvP wins against human opponents; queue availability varies.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Queued PvP wins against human opponents; queue availability varies.\n\n1. Open the Pet Journal and build a team of three similarly leveled battle pets. Choose complementary damage families, avoidance and recovery rather than three pets sharing the same weakness.\n\n2. Use Find Battle to queue against another player. Direct pet duels with a selected friend and NPC/wild battles do not satisfy this series. Any eligible team level can count; the level-25-only series is separate.\n\n3. Win 10 queued matches. These wins accumulate rather than requiring one uninterrupted streak. Learn from opposing teams and adjust your lineup between matches; the Pet Battle bonus event often brings more people into the queue. An opponent's forfeit can count as your victory.",
        stepCount = 3,
        waypoints = {},
        sources = {
