        name = "Eastern Kingdoms Tamer",
        source = "Eastern Kingdoms Tamer",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Capture one wild pet in every listed zone.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Capture one wild pet in every listed zone.\n\n1. Prepare a capture team, unlock Trap and track this achievement. Visit the original continent named here; Outland Nagrand and Shadowmoon Valley are different zones from their Draenor counterparts.\n\n2. Capture one paw-marked wild pet in EACH of these zones: Arathi Highlands, Badlands, Blasted Lands, Burning Steppes, Cape of Stranglethorn, Northern Stranglethorn, Deadwind Pass, Duskwood, Eastern Plaguelands, Western Plaguelands, Elwynn Forest, Eversong Woods, Ghostlands, Hillsbrad Foothills, Hinterlands, Loch Modan, Redridge Mountains, Searing Gorge, Silverpine Forest, Swamp of Sorrows, Tirisfal Glades, Twilight Highlands, Westfall and Wetlands. Reduce its health below 35%, trap it and finish the battle successfully. Any capturable species and quality can satisfy that zone.\n\n3. Check the zone criterion before traveling onward. A purchased cage and merely winning without a capture do not replace a zone capture. If an invasion or destroyed phase has no suitable spawns, use that zone's Zidormi option to access its earlier Retail phase.",
