        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Win 10 pet battles consecutively.\n\n1. Put healthy strong pets in your team and find low-level wild pets in a starting zone. There is no requirement to use level-25 enemies for this streak.\n\n2. Win complete battles and heal between them. Avoid forfeits or unnecessary difficult tamers while building the streak; overleveled pets can safely defeat the small wild teams.\n\n3. Continue until 10 consecutive wins complete the achievement. Early comments about additional pet-death restrictions refer to launch bugs; keeping the team alive remains an easy way to avoid ambiguity.",
