        name = "Terrific Trio",
        source = "Terrific Trio",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Level several different classes to the current Retail cap.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Level several different classes to the current Retail cap.\n\n1. Choose 3 DIFFERENT classes on your account. Multiple characters of one class supply only one class criterion; faction and realm do not need to match.\n\n2. Level each chosen class to the current maximum level, then log into each so the account's criteria update. Old expansion caps in historical comments are no longer sufficient for a new completion.\n\n3. Check the distinct-class total for the achievement and its Warband Bank Distance Inhibitor cooldown reward. Changing specializations does not create a new class criterion.",
