        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Thousands of actual daily quest turn-ins require sustained play.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Thousands of actual daily quest turn-ins require sustained play.\n\n1. Track the daily-quest counter and complete quests explicitly offered as DAILY, turning them in rather than only finishing objectives. Do not assume world quests, repeatable hand-ins or a rare's hidden daily flag count as normal dailies.\n\n2. Combine the grind with unfinished reputation routes. Argent Tournament and Shadow Vault dailies in Icecrown have current successful reports; Pandaria faction hubs also offer ordinary blue-exclamation daily quests. Check the counter after a representative hand-in before repeating a large route.\n\n3. Return after daily resets and continue to 5000 credited turn-ins. Use alts where the offered daily and achievement progress permit it. Old shortcuts involving garrison activities or repeatable bone hand-ins are not guaranteed by the current counter.",
