        difficultyReason = "Raise one pet to level 3.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Raise one pet to level 3.\n\n1. Learn Battle Pet Training from Audrey Burnhep in Stormwind or Varzok in Orgrimmar. Put a healthy battle-capable pet into your Pet Journal's team and enable wild-pet tracking on the minimap.\n\n2. Win wild-pet or unlocked tamer battles with the pet participating and surviving. Start with opponents near its level. As your team improves, let a stronger pet finish after the learner has safely participated; a dead learner receives no experience.\n\n3. Raise the pet through level 3 and check credit. Learning a cage already above the target is not the same as raising it through the level yourself. Pet bandages, Revive Battle Pets and stable masters keep the team healthy between battles.",
