        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Successfully capture 200 wild pets.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Successfully capture 200 wild pets.\n\n1. Learn Battle Pet Training from Audrey Burnhep in Stormwind or Varzok in Orgrimmar. Put a healthy battle-capable pet into your Pet Journal's team and enable wild-pet tracking on the minimap.\n\n2. Battle wild pets marked with green paws. Lower the pet you want below 35% health, then use Trap until a capture succeeds. Finish the battle successfully to keep the capture; one enemy per battle can be captured.\n\n3. Repeat until 200 captures are credited. This is a CAPTURE counter, not your number of owned species: vendor pets and learned cages do not replace captures, and ordinary qualities are acceptable. Combine it with zone captures and Safari species; release unwanted duplicates when your species slots fill.",
