        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Capture 1 rare-quality wild pet.\n\n1. Learn Battle Pet Training from Audrey Burnhep in Stormwind or Varzok in Orgrimmar. Put a healthy battle-capable pet into your Pet Journal's team and enable wild-pet tracking on the minimap.\n\n2. Start a wild pet battle and inspect ALL enemy pets' quality borders. You need BLUE rare quality. Secondary opponents can be valid captures too; no quality-inspection macro is needed in the current interface.\n\n3. Reduce the chosen pet below 35%, trap it and finish the battle. Repeat until 1 qualifying captures are credited. Duplicate species can count; a quality-upgrade stone or a bought rare cage is not a wild capture. Leave a species slot free before trapping duplicates.",
