        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Twelve random raid drops, or learn their tradeable cages.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Twelve random raid drops, or learn their tradeable cages.\n\n1. Check the twelve named species in the achievement before farming. All twelve can be learned from cages traded by other players, which satisfies this collection achievement. Mr. Bigglesworth is the reward, not a thirteenth raid drop.\n\n2. Enter Molten Core through Lothos in Blackrock Mountain. Kill Magmadar for Corefire Imp, Golemagg for Ashstone Core and Sulfuron Harbinger for Harbinger of Flame. Loot and learn their pet items when they drop.\n\n3. Use the Orb of Command for Blackwing Lair. Control Razorgore with the room's orb and destroy ALL eggs before killing him for Untamed Hatchling. Continue to Broodlord Lashlayer for Death Talon Whelpguard and Chromaggus for Chrominius.\n\n4. Enter the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj raid, not its Ruins dungeon. Prophet Skeram drops Anubisath Idol, Viscidus drops Viscidus Globule and the Twin Emperors drop Mini Mindslayer. Viscidus must be frozen with repeated Frost hits and then shattered with rapid melee hits; bring suitable Frost attacks and fast melee weapons rather than only high burst damage.\n\n5. Enter the floating Wrath Naxxramas in Dragonblight. Take the Arachnid Quarter through Maexxna for Giant Bone Spider, the Plague Quarter through Loatheb for Fungal Abomination and the Construct Quarter through Gluth for Stitched Pup. The removed original level-60 Naxxramas is unnecessary.\n\n6. Retry missing drops on another eligible character or after the weekly reset, or buy their cages. Learn every missing species and collect Mr. Bigglesworth from the achievement mail. Ordinary raid lockout resets do not refresh already looted bosses.",
        stepCount = 6,
        waypoints = {
            {
                mapID = 36,
                x = 0.20800000000000002,
                y = 0.374,
                step = 2,
                label = "Blackrock Mountain - Molten Core / Blackwing Lair",
            },
            { mapID = 327, x = 0.46799999999999997, y = 0.075, step = 4, label = "Temple of Ahn'Qiraj entrance" },
            { mapID = 115, x = 0.875, y = 0.51, step = 5, label = "Naxxramas - fly beneath the floating fortress" },
        },
        sources = { "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7934#comments:id=1748804" },
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7934",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7934#comments",
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-13",
    },
    [8052] = {
        achievementId = 8052,
        name = "Khan",
        source = "Khan",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Five battleground mastery metas span expansions and many team-dependent matches.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Five battleground mastery metas span expansions and many team-dependent matches.\n\n1. Track Master of the Battle for Gilneas, Master of Isle of Conquest, Master of Twin Peaks, Master of Silvershard Mines and Master of Temple of Kotmogu. These are the five required metas for the Alliance version; this is not a retired arena-season title.\n\n2. Use each battleground's individual guides and finish its single-match challenges while accumulating veteran victories. For the two Pandaria maps, combine carrier/color objectives at Kotmogu and the cart-route/deathless objectives at Silvershard, then finish their hundred-win totals.\n\n3. Check all five completed metas for the Khan title. This cross-expansion achievement is filed under General; it does not require new catalogue entries or the retired original Deepwind cart achievements.",
        stepCount = 3,
        waypoints = {},
        areaMaps = { 217, 275, 423, 449, 206 },
        sources = {},
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=8052",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=8052#comments",
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-13",
    },
