    [8348] = {
        achievementId = 8348,
        name = "The Longest Day",
        source = "The Longest Day",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Many unlocked trainer dailies and ten legendary beasts require travel and a broad roster.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Many unlocked trainer dailies and ten legendary beasts require travel and a broad roster.\n\n1. Complete the introductory tamer story through Aki, Pandaren Spirit Tamer (32428), and the original Beasts of Fable introduction (32603), so their repeatable dailies are available. Accept the DAILY versions before fighting; repeating a trainer without its daily does not complete that daily criterion.\n\n2. Complete your faction's early Eastern Kingdoms or Kalimdor dailies and both grand masters: Lydia Accoste in Deadwind Pass and Stone Cold Trixxy in Winterspring. Use the regional Taming guides for every trainer and family counter. You do not need the opposite faction's restricted early dailies.\n\n3. Complete the five Outland and five Northrend trainer dailies, then Brok, Bordin, Goz and Obalis in Cataclysm. Use capital portals between the Cataclysm zones and Zidormi's earlier Uldum if necessary. Deiza's current Eastern Plaguelands position is near 66.55,56.99, rather than the old 67,52.4 pin.\n\n4. Complete all seven Pandaria trainer dailies and all four Spirit dailies. Use earlier Vale Aki at 31.2,74.2 rather than old pre-5.4 coordinates. Mo'ruk patrols the Krasarang coast and Yon is inside the Kota Peak cave.\n\n5. Complete all three Beasts of Fable books. Book I: Nitun and Ka'wi in Jade Forest, Kafi and Dos-Ryga in Kun-Lai. Book II: Lucky Yi and Greyhoof in the Valley, Xi'a in Krasarang. Book III: Ti'un in Townlong, No-No in the earlier Vale and Gorespine in Dread Wastes. Bring teams suited to their reduced-damage boss passives and turn each book in at your shrine.\n\n6. Check every daily criterion and return for any missing turn-in. The current Retail tooltip no longer says to do this in one day, and comments confirm retained credit across days; do not abandon partial progress because an old guide imposed the original timer. Use the awarded Marked Flawless Battle-Stone on a pet you want to upgrade.",
