        name = "Crazy for Cats",
        source = "Crazy for Cats",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Collect twenty listed cats; this route avoids discontinued promotions.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Collect twenty listed cats; this route avoids discontinued promotions.\n\n1. Track the achievement's named cats; twenty are required, not all twenty-six. Buy Bombay, Cornish Rex, Orange Tabby and Silver Tabby from Donni Anthania in Elwynn 44.2,53.2. These four tradeable cats can also be learned from cages on the Auction House.\n\n2. Buy Siamese Cat from Dealer Rashaad in Netherstorm 43.4,35.2; Calico Cat from Breanni in Northrend Dalaran 58.6,39.6; Winterspring Cub from Michelle De Rum in Everlook 59.8,51.6. Find Lil Timmy on his Stormwind canal patrol for White Kitten, or buy its cage. That gives eight vendor cats.\n\n3. Capture Cat in Elwynn or earlier Arathi, Cheetah Cub beneath Northern Barrens trees, Sand Kitten in Tanaris, Snow Cub in Dun Morogh and Fluxfire Feline around New Tinkertown/Gnomeregan. Use a trapped primary or backline pet and win the battle. These five bring the route to thirteen.\n\n4. Learn Black Tabby Cat from its Hillsbrad world drop or a cage, and Sapphire Cub from Pandaria Jewelcrafting or a cage. Complete the Stranglethorn Panther Cub quest route ending Some Good Will Come; a later Zandalari campaign is not the same quest. This brings the route to sixteen.\n\n5. Earn Mr. Bigglesworth through Raiding with Leashes and buy Xu-Fu from Master Li for three Celestial Coins. During the Darkmoon Faire buy Darkmoon Cub from Lhara; during Hallow's End buy Feline Familiar with Tricky Treats or learn a cage. These reach twenty without Spectral Cub, Spectral Tiger Cub, Nightsaber Cub, Guardian Cub or store-only cats.\n\n6. Learn every teaching item and inspect the achievement's individual ticks. Duplicate cats do not replace a missing species. Event pets may require waiting for their holiday; the achievement itself is still obtainable and is classified under General.",
        stepCount = 6,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 37, x = 0.442, y = 0.532, step = 1, label = "Donni Anthania - four cats" },
            { mapID = 109, x = 0.434, y = 0.35200000000000004, step = 2, label = "Dealer Rashaad - Siamese Cat" },
            { mapID = 125, x = 0.586, y = 0.396, step = 2, label = "Breanni - Calico Cat" },
            { mapID = 83, x = 0.598, y = 0.516, step = 2, label = "Michelle De Rum - Winterspring Cub" },
            { mapID = 554, x = 0.348, y = 0.596, step = 5, label = "Master Li - Xu-Fu" },
            { mapID = 407, x = 0.486, y = 0.698, step = 5, label = "Lhara - Darkmoon Cub during the Faire" },
        },
        areaMaps = { 84, 10, 71, 27, 469, 25 },
