    [9575] = {
        achievementId = 9575,
        name = "Proving Yourself: Endless Damage (Wave 10)",
        source = "Proving Yourself: Endless Damage (Wave 10)",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Complete the damage trial at Endless through wave 10.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Complete the damage trial at Endless through wave 10.\n\n1. Go to Trial Master Rotun inside the Temple of the White Tiger in Kun-Lai Summit and enter Proving Grounds. Use a damage specialization and select the corresponding role trial; this is not a retired timed dungeon Challenge Mode.\n\n2. Finish preceding medals for that role if needed to unlock Endless, then start the required trial. Kill healers promptly or interrupt their heals. Attack shielded defenders from behind, kite amber globules into enemies, and kill newly spawned banshees before their short timer explodes. Save the arena's Berserking pickups and major cooldowns for the late Sha waves; wait until the Sha's damage-reduction shield drops before spending burst.\n\n3. Survive and complete at least wave 10 in Endless. The waves repeat with increasing pressure; keep cooldowns for the same dangerous points each cycle. Do not stop at the start of the numbered wave: finish it.\n\n4. After the required waves, end the run through Rotun's 'I yield' option or an ordinary defeat. DO NOT use Leave Instance as your first exit: multiple later comments and replies say the achievement is processed when the trial ends. Check credit before leaving the scenario.\n\n5. Use current-level gear and abilities. The MoP Remix cloak shortcuts and old expansion talents in popular comments are time-limited or obsolete and are not prerequisites for a Retail attempt.",
