        name = "Proving Yourself: Bronze Tank",
        source = "Proving Yourself: Bronze Tank",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Complete the tank trial at Bronze.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Complete the tank trial at Bronze.\n\n1. Go to Trial Master Rotun inside the Temple of the White Tiger in Kun-Lai Summit and enter Proving Grounds. Use a tank specialization and select the corresponding role trial; this is not a retired timed dungeon Challenge Mode.\n\n2. Finish preceding medals for that role if needed to unlock Bronze, then start the required trial. Keep enemies off Sikari with taunts and area threat. Face dangerous attacks away from her, move out of ground effects and kite enemies through the damaging fire when available. Rotate defensive cooldowns for enrages and the larger final packs; surviving alone while Sikari dies fails the trial.\n\n3. Complete every wave of Bronze before the trial ends. A higher role medal may award earlier tiers, but another role's medal does not replace this role's requirement.\n\n4. After the required waves, end the run through Rotun's 'I yield' option or an ordinary defeat. DO NOT use Leave Instance as your first exit: multiple later comments and replies say the achievement is processed when the trial ends. Check credit before leaving the scenario.\n\n5. Use current-level gear and abilities. The MoP Remix cloak shortcuts and old expansion talents in popular comments are time-limited or obsolete and are not prerequisites for a Retail attempt.",
