        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Complete the tank trial at Endless through wave 10.\n\n1. Go to Trial Master Rotun inside the Temple of the White Tiger in Kun-Lai Summit and enter Proving Grounds. Use a tank specialization and select the corresponding role trial; this is not a retired timed dungeon Challenge Mode.\n\n2. Finish preceding medals for that role if needed to unlock Endless, then start the required trial. Keep enemies off Sikari with taunts and area threat. Face dangerous attacks away from her, move out of ground effects and kite enemies through the damaging fire when available. Rotate defensive cooldowns for enrages and the larger final packs; surviving alone while Sikari dies fails the trial.\n\n3. Survive and complete at least wave 10 in Endless. The waves repeat with increasing pressure; keep cooldowns for the same dangerous points each cycle. Do not stop at the start of the numbered wave: finish it.\n\n4. After the required waves, end the run through Rotun's 'I yield' option or an ordinary defeat. DO NOT use Leave Instance as your first exit: multiple later comments and replies say the achievement is processed when the trial ends. Check credit before leaving the scenario.\n\n5. Use current-level gear and abilities. The MoP Remix cloak shortcuts and old expansion talents in popular comments are time-limited or obsolete and are not prerequisites for a Retail attempt.",
        stepCount = 5,
        waypoints = {
            {
                mapID = 379,
