    [9584] = {
        achievementId = 9584,
        name = "Proving Yourself: Bronze Healer",
        source = "Proving Yourself: Bronze Healer",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Complete the healer trial at Bronze.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Complete the healer trial at Bronze.\n\n1. Go to Trial Master Rotun inside the Temple of the White Tiger in Kun-Lai Summit and enter Proving Grounds. Use a healer specialization and select the corresponding role trial; this is not a retired timed dungeon Challenge Mode.\n\n2. Finish preceding medals for that role if needed to unlock Bronze, then start the required trial. Keep the full NPC party alive, dispel dangerous effects promptly, and use available interrupts or stuns to reduce incoming damage. Save major healing cooldowns for overlapping heavy-damage waves. Current Midnight comments warn that some healing specializations have fewer interrupts than the old guides assume; use your actual current toolkit instead of obsolete talents.\n\n3. Complete every wave of Bronze before the trial ends. A higher role medal may award earlier tiers, but another role's medal does not replace this role's requirement.\n\n4. After the required waves, end the run through Rotun's 'I yield' option or an ordinary defeat. DO NOT use Leave Instance as your first exit: multiple later comments and replies say the achievement is processed when the trial ends. Check credit before leaving the scenario.\n\n5. Use current-level gear and abilities. The MoP Remix cloak shortcuts and old expansion talents in popular comments are time-limited or obsolete and are not prerequisites for a Retail attempt.",
