        difficultyReason = "Finish a role trial while your specialization belongs to another role.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Finish a role trial while your specialization belongs to another role.\n\n1. Enter Proving Grounds through Trial Master Rotun at the Temple of the White Tiger. Unlock the required Gold trial first. Choose a role DIFFERENT from your current specialization and keep that specialization throughout the qualifying run.\n\n2. A practical documented route is the Damage trial in a tank specialization such as Protection, Guardian or Blood. Interrupt healers, hit defenders from behind, kite amber into enemies and kill banshees immediately. Save both Berserking pickups for late Sha shield-down windows rather than spending them on easy opening waves.\n\n3. An alternative is the Tank trial in a healer specialization: maintain yourself and Sikari, control enemy packs and use defensives for the last enrages. Choose the option supported by your class toolkit; a role-selection button alone does not change the specialization's role.\n\n4. Finish Gold and let the trial end before leaving. Current 2025 comments confirm the Gold feat remains obtainable; its zero achievement points do not mean it was retired. Ignore unavailable Remix, old borrowed-power and Gladiator Stance strategies.",
