        difficultyReason = "Unlock 1 different heirlooms; upgrades and duplicates are unnecessary.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Unlock 1 different heirlooms; upgrades and duplicates are unnecessary.\n\n1. Open Collections > Heirlooms and track Where's the Mailbox?. The requirement is 1 different heirloom unlocks, not their upgrade levels or how many copies you create for alts.\n\n2. Alliance: visit Krom Stoutarm in Ironforge (74.6,9.8). Horde: visit Estelle Gendry at Orgrimmar's gates (57,89.8) in the present-day phase. Compare the shop with your collection and purchase missing base heirlooms using the displayed currency.\n\n3. Use / register the new heirlooms and check the unique counter. Choose inexpensive missing armor pieces before expensive upgrade tokens; raising an already collected item's level range does not create another unlock.\n\n4. At 1 unlocks the achievement completes. Continue to 35 for Heirloom Hoarder and its chauffeur mount if desired; that later milestone is separate.",
